        {
          "id": 2023284674,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Try `Telephony -> LTE -> ...` for current failure errors.  \n```\n    case(HELP_STATS_LTE_MAC_TRAFFIC_DIALOG):\n        url = user_guide_url(\"ChTelLTE.html#ChTelLTEMACTraffic\");\n        break;\n    case(HELP_STATS_LTE_RLC_TRAFFIC_DIALOG):\n        url = user_guide_url(\"ChTelLTE.html#ChTelLTERLCTraffic\");\n        break;\n```\n\n[How to use #/fragment identifier with file:// URI/URL protocol](urlhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/64333801/how-to-use-fragment-identifier-with-file-uri-url-protocol)\n\n[How do I use QDesktopServices::openUrl with 'file:' URL containing '#'?](urlhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/31563699/how-do-i-use-qdesktopservicesopenurl-with-file-url-containing)\n\n[Can't open an HTML on a specific fragment in QT using hash](urlhttps://forum.qt.io/topic/117169/can-t-open-an-html-on-a-specific-fragment-in-qt-using-hash)\n\n[ShellExecute fails for local html or file URLs](urlhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/26305322/shellexecute-fails-for-local-html-or-file-urls)\n\n[C++, ShellExecute a URL with the hash sign (#)](urlhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/32553974/c-shellexecute-a-url-with-the-hash-sign)\n\n[CSH Workaround for ShellExecute URL failures](urlhttps://forums.madcapsoftware.com/viewtopic.php?t=19971)",
