        {
          "id": 2026352853,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "On my Windows 11 box, if I replace that line with so:\n\n`QDesktopServices::openUrl(QUrl(QDir::fromNativeSeparators(url)))`\n\nthen it all works, including the fragment. If I do not call `QDir::fromNativeSeparators(url)`, then it replaces the backslashes with `%5C`, which causes it not to work.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
